{"type":"message","id":"c122976e","parentId":"86acc8ed","timestamp":"2026-05-01T17:38:36.503Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking what we were last talking about. Let me look at the context - from their previous message at 15:16, they asked me to send a Telegram reminder, which I did. Before that, we were discussing:\n\n1. Changing the default model to deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro (done ✅)\n2. Fixing fallback from openrouter to openrouter/auto (in progress)\n3. Webchat capabilities - exec and gateway enabled in config but not yet active\n4. Perplexity fix needed for tomorrow (May 2)\n5. User wanted to create a fresh session to build a service for saving conversation history with clients\n\nThe user seems to be coming back now after a few hours (19:38 vs the ~16:15 reminder time). They want a recap.\n\nI don't need to call any tools for this - I already have the context fresh.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Certo! Stavamo sistemando la configurazione del gateway, su tre fronti:\n\n1. **Modello default** → `deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro` ✅ fatto\n2. **Fallback agent main** → da `openrouter` a `openrouter/auto` ⚠️ il `sed` l'hai lanciato? Da verificare\n3. **Webchat capabilities** → `exec` e `gateway` abilitati nel config YAML ma ancora non attivi in sessione\n\nPoi avevi chiesto una **nuova sessione fresca** per preparare un servizio che salva lo storico delle conversazioni con clienti — dicevi di sapere già cosa vuoi e come farlo.\n\nE c'era il reminder su **Perplexity** da fixare domani 02/05 (errore 400 JSON su `sonar-pro`).\n\nTi ho mandato il reminder su Telegram alle 16:15 circa 📲\n\nVuoi riprendere da uno di questi punti?"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":180,"output":407,"cacheRead":31360,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":31947,"cost":{"input":0.0003132,"output":0.00141636,"cacheRead":0.0045471999999999995,"cacheWrite":0,"tot