{"type":"message","id":"3367d08b","parentId":"e98d0697","timestamp":"2026-05-01T18:16:18.214Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK, model is `deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro` ✅. Fallback is `openrouter` (not `openrouter/auto`). Capabilities still say nothing explicit in the status line.\n\nLet me check what we can do now. The user seems to want to proceed. Let me ask what they want to tackle:\n\n1. Fix the fallback (openrouter → openrouter/auto)\n2. Fix webchat capabilities\n3. Work on the client history service (new fresh session)\n4. Fix Perplexity\n\nLet me ask the user which they want to address. The last specific topics were:\n- Verifying the fallback sed was applied\n- Webchat capabilities still not active\n- New session for client history service\n\nLet me ask directly what they want to do.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Modello V4 Pro confermato ✅. Fallback ancora `openrouter` (quel `sed` non ha attecchito), e capabilities webchat ancora limitati.\n\nDa dove vuoi ripartire?\n\n1. **Fix fallback** — `openrouter` → `openrouter/auto` (una riga sola, risolviamo subito)\n2. **Webchat capabilities** — capire perché `exec`/`gateway` non si attivano nonostante il config\n3. **Servizio storico clienti** — apriamo la sessione fresca e iniziamo\n4. **Perplexity** — rimandato a domani, come da piano\n\nDimmi tu 🎯"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":238,"output":318,"cacheRead":31872,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":32428,"cost":{"input":0.00041412,"output":0.00110664,"cacheRead":0.004621439999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0061422}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777659368326,"responseId":"294691eb-2e22-4737-b291-09b9e7417206"}}
