{"type":"message","id":"0b46a8af","parentId":"faa53e0a","timestamp":"2026-05-01T18:18:27.063Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to open a new webchat session. I don't have the ability to create new sessions directly - I don't have `sessions_spawn` in my tool list. But the user can open a new webchat tab in their browser. Let me tell them to do that.\n\nActually, they might be asking me to try to spawn a new session. Let me try using sessions_spawn even though it's not in my tool list. If it doesn't work, I'll tell them to open a new tab themselves.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Non ho `sessions_spawn` in questa sessione (sempre quei capabilities limitati). Ma è semplicissimo: apri una nuova tab del browser su **Comet** e vai all'indirizzo della webchat di OpenClaw — solitamente:\n\n```\nhttp://localhost:18789\n```\n\nOppure se hai l'interfaccia Control UI già aperta, clicca su **\"New Chat\"** e scrivimi lì. Io rispondo automaticamente nella sessione da cui mi scrivi 🔄\n\nDue sessioni parallele, zero problemi 🚀"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":129,"output":235,"cacheRead":33024,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":33388,"cost":{"input":0.00022446,"output":0.0008178,"cacheRead":0.0047884799999999995,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.005830739999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777659498045,"responseId":"76f90596-ca13-4643-9b90-bcf5eaf0efd2"}}
