{"type":"message","id":"2d6b0e9c","parentId":"cf436361","timestamp":"2026-05-01T21:26:24.094Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user chose the second approach - parsing the plain text format. Let me refine the awk command to handle the log format properly and output in YAML.\n\nThe log format is:\n```\n2026-04-27T22:15:06.478+02:00 [gateway] loading configuration…\n```\n\nSo:\n- Characters 1-25: timestamp (ISO 8601)\n- Then space + bracketed subsystem\n- Then the message\n\nLet me also handle the JSON messages that sometimes appear - like the liveness warning that was embedded as a JSON string.\n\nI'll build a more robust parser that:\n1. Extracts timestamp, subsystem, and message\n2. Tries to parse the message as JSON (for the diagnostic warnings)\n3. Outputs clean YAML\n\n```bash\ntail -f ~/.openclaw/logs/gateway.log | while IFS= read -r line; do\n  time=$(echo \"$line\" | sed -E 's/^([0-9T:.+-]+).*/\\1/')\n  subsystem=$(echo \"$line\" | sed -E 's/^[^ ]+ \\[([^]]+)\\].*/\\1/')\n  message=$(echo \"$line\" | sed -E 's/^[^ ]+ \\[[^]]+\\] //')\n  \n  echo \"---\"\n  echo \"time: $time\"\n  echo \"subsystem: $subsystem\"\n  # Try to parse message as JSON\n  if echo \"$message\" | jq -e . >/dev/null 2>&1; then\n    echo \"message:\"\n    echo \"$message\" | jq -r 'to_entries[] | \"  \\(.key): \\(.value)\"'\n  else\n    echo \"message: $message\"\n  fi\ndone\n```\n\nActually, this is getting complex. Let me give a simpler approach using Python which handles JSON detection better.\n\nActually, let me just give them a Python script that does it properly - it'll handle both plain text messages and JSON-embedded messages (like the liveness warning), outputting clean YAML.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Ecco il parser raffinato — gestisce sia plain text che messaggi JSON nidificati:\n\n```bash\ntail -f ~/.openclaw/logs/gateway.log | python3 -c '\nimport sys, json, re\n\nfor line in sys.stdin:\n    line = line.rstrip()\n    m = re.match(r\"^(\\S+)\\s+\\[(\\w+)\\]\\s+(.*)\", line)\n    if not m:\n        print(line)\n        continue\n    t, sub, msg = m.groups()\n    print(\"---\")\n    print(f\"time: {t}\")\n    print(f\"subsystem: {sub}\")\n    try:\n        inner = json.loads(msg)\n        print(\"message:\")\n        for k, v in inner.items():\n            print(f\"  {k}: {v}\")\n    except (json.JSONDecodeError, ValueError):\n        print(f\"message: {msg}\")\n'\n```\n\nOutput esempio:\n\n```yaml\n---\ntime: 2026-05-01T23:13:52.745+02:00\nsubsystem: diagnostic\nmessage:\n  event: liveness_warning\n  reasons: event_loop_delay\n  eventLoopDelayP99Ms: 660.1\n  eventLoopDelayMaxMs: 7293.9\n  eventLoopUtilization: 0.763\n  cpuCoreRatio: 0.788\n  active: 0\n  waiting: 0\n  queued: 0\n---\ntime: 2026-05-01T23:14:00.123+02:00\nsubsystem: gateway\nmessage: loading configuration…\n```\n\nI JSON nidificati vengono espansi in livelli YAML puliti ✨"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":345,"output":812,"cacheRead":39936,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41093,"cost":{"input":0.0006003,"output":0.00282576,"cacheRead":0.005790719999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.009216779999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777670757232,"responseId":"1dfcb36b-05f2-4199-b989-e22838b15359"}}
{"type":"message","id":"c653b3a7","parentId":"2d6b0e9c","timestamp":"2026-05-01T21:31:00.222Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Fri 2026-05-01 23:30 GMT+2] io ho incollato questo in terminal\n\ntail -f ~/.openclaw/logs/gateway.log | python3 -c '\nimport sys, json, re\n\nfor line in sys.stdin:\n line = line.rstrip()\n m = re.match(r\"^(\\S+)\\s+\\[(\\w+)\\]\\s+(.*)\", line)\n if not m:\n print(line)\n continue\n t, sub, msg = m.groups()\n print(\"---\")\n print(f\"time: {t}\")\n print(f\"subsystem: {sub}\")\n try:\n inner = json.loads(msg)\n print(\"message:\")\n for k, v in inner.items():\n print(f\" {k}: {v}\")\n except (json.JSONDecodeError, ValueError):\n print(f\"message: {msg}\")"}],"timestamp":1777671060132}}
