{"type":"message","id":"9247eaa9","parentId":"c102c132","timestamp":"2026-05-01T21:31:18.334Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is showing what they pasted - but it looks like the indentation got lost in the copy-paste. Python requires proper indentation inside the for loops and try/except blocks. The code they pasted has lost all indentation because of how it was copied.\n\nLet me give them a fixed version that's properly formatted. I should also note that the `tail -f` will hang waiting for new lines - they might want to use `cat` first to test.\n\nLet me provide a properly indented version.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"L'indentazione si è persa nel copia-incolla. Eccolo con gli spazi giusti:\n\n```bash\ntail -f ~/.openclaw/logs/gateway.log | python3 -c '\nimport sys, json, re\n\nfor line in sys.stdin:\n    line = line.rstrip()\n    m = re.match(r\"^(\\S+)\\s+\\[(\\w+)\\]\\s+(.*)\", line)\n    if not m:\n        print(line)\n        continue\n    t, sub, msg = m.groups()\n    print(\"---\")\n    print(f\"time: {t}\")\n    print(f\"subsystem: {sub}\")\n    try:\n        inner = json.loads(msg)\n        print(\"message:\")\n        for k, v in inner.items():\n            print(f\"  {k}: {v}\")\n    except (json.JSONDecodeError, ValueError):\n        print(f\"message: {msg}\")\n'\n```\n\n⚠️ **Nota:** `tail -f` rimane in ascolto. Per testarlo prima, usa `cat` al posto di `tail -f`:\n\n```bash\ncat ~/.openclaw/logs/gateway.log | python3 -c '\nimport sys, json, re\n\nfor line in sys.stdin:\n    line = line.rstrip()\n    m = re.match(r\"^(\\S+)\\s+\\[(\\w+)\\]\\s+(.*)\", line)\n    if not m:\n        print(line)\n        continue\n    t, sub, msg = m.groups()\n    print(\"---\")\n    print(f\"time: {t}\")\n    print(f\"subsystem: {sub}\")\n    try:\n        inner = json.loads(msg)\n        print(\"message:\")\n        for k, v in inner.items():\n            print(f\"  {k}: {v}\")\n    except (json.JSONDecodeError, ValueError):\n        print(f\"message: {msg}\")\n'\n```"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":640,"output":514,"cacheRead":40192,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41346,"cost":{"input":0.0011136,"output":0.0017887200000000002,"cacheRead":0.00582784,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00873016}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777671060317,"responseId":"2f72acb5-2791-40c7-9e2a-6d9e758001cb"}}
