{"type":"message","id":"6b7e479c","parentId":"36992758","timestamp":"2026-05-01T21:32:06.402Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants colorized output. The script currently prints plain YAML-like text. To add color, we can use ANSI escape codes in Python. Let me enhance the script with color support.\n\nWe want:\n- `---` maybe in dim/gray\n- `time:` in cyan or yellow\n- `subsystem:` in green\n- `message:` key in magenta/bold\n- Values in white/default\n- Maybe different levels in different colors\n\nLet me write a Python script with ANSI color codes.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Aggiungo colori ANSI:\n\n```bash\ntail -f ~/.openclaw/logs/gateway.log | python3 -c '\nimport sys, json, re\n\n# ANSI colors\nDIM = \"\\033[2m\"\nBOLD = \"\\033[1m\"\nRST = \"\\033[0m\"\nC = {\"time\":\"\\033[36m\", \"sub\":\"\\033[32m\", \"key\":\"\\033[35m\", \"val\":\"\\033[37m\", \"warn\":\"\\033[33m\", \"err\":\"\\033[31m\", \"dim\":\"\\033[2m\"}\n\ndef color_level(level):\n    if level in (\"error\",\"fatal\"): return C[\"err\"] + level.upper() + RST\n    if level in (\"warn\",\"warning\"): return C[\"warn\"] + level.upper() + RST\n    return level.upper()\n\nfor line in sys.stdin:\n    line = line.rstrip()\n    m = re.match(r\"^(\\S+)\\s+\\[(\\w+)\\]\\s+(.*)\", line)\n    if not m:\n        print(line)\n        continue\n    t, sub, msg = m.groups()\n    print(DIM + \"---\" + RST)\n    print(C[\"time\"] + \"time:\" + RST, t)\n    print(C[\"sub\"] + \"subsystem:\" + RST, sub)\n    try:\n        inner = json.loads(msg)\n        print(C[\"key\"] + \"message:\" + RST)\n        for k, v in inner.items():\n            if k == \"level\":\n                print(f\"  {C['key']}{k}:{RST} {color_level(str(v))}\")\n            else:\n                print(f\"  {C['key']}{k}:{RST} {C['val']}{v}{RST}\")\n    except (json.JSONDecodeError, ValueError):\n        print(C[\"key\"] + \"message:\" + RST, msg)\n'\n```\n\nRisultato: time in ciano, subsystem in verde, chiavi in viola, valori in bianco, WARN/ERROR colorati. Vuoi regolare la palette?"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":575,"output":579,"cacheRead":40704,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41858,"cost":{"input":0.0010005,"output":0.00201492,"cacheRead":0.00590208,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0089175}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777671109012,"responseId":"4d2f7463-974f-44ed-94d8-7723bc1f1107"}}
