{"type":"message","id":"982b47b5","parentId":"89dbadd0","timestamp":"2026-05-01T21:34:47.691Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to save this command as a shell function or alias so they can reuse it easily. The best way is to add it to their `~/.zshrc` as a function.\n\nLet me give them a clean one-liner to append to their zshrc.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Aggiungilo come funzione nel tuo `~/.zshrc`:\n\n```bash\ncat >> ~/.zshrc << 'EOF'\n\n# OpenClaw log viewer con colori\nocl() {\n  tail -f ~/.openclaw/logs/gateway.log | python3 -c '\nimport sys, json, re\nC = {\"time\":\"\\033[36m\", \"sub\":\"\\033[32m\", \"key\":\"\\033[35m\", \"val\":\"\\033[37m\", \"warn\":\"\\033[33m\", \"err\":\"\\033[31m\", \"dim\":\"\\033[2m\"}\nRST = \"\\033[0m\"\nfor line in sys.stdin:\n    line = line.rstrip()\n    m = re.match(r\"^(\\S+)\\s+\\[(\\w+)\\]\\s+(.*)\", line)\n    if not m: print(line); continue\n    t, sub, msg = m.groups()\n    print(C[\"dim\"]+\"---\"+RST)\n    print(C[\"time\"]+\"time:\"+RST, t)\n    print(C[\"sub\"]+\"subsystem:\"+RST, sub)\n    try:\n        inner = json.loads(msg)\n        print(C[\"key\"]+\"message:\"+RST)\n        for k, v in inner.items():\n            clr = C[\"err\"] if str(v).lower() in (\"error\",\"fatal\") else C[\"warn\"] if str(v).lower() in (\"warn\",\"warning\") else C[\"val\"]\n            print(f\"  {C['key']}{k}:{RST} {clr}{v}{RST}\")\n    except:\n        print(C[\"key\"]+\"message:\"+RST, msg)\n'\n}\nEOF\n```\n\nPoi ricarica:\n\n```bash\nsource ~/.zshrc\n```\n\nDa ora in poi basta digitare **`ocl`** per vedere i log colorati 🚀\n\nVariante senza `-f` (one-shot) se vuoi:\n\n```bash\noclog() { cat ~/.openclaw/logs/gateway.log | python3 ... }\n```"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":584,"output":513,"cacheRead":41216,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":42313,"cost":{"input":0.0010161600000000001,"output":0.00178524,"cacheRead":0.005976319999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00877772}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777671271030,"responseId":"ec40e04a-658c-4fdc-a27e-027101d9f5d0"}}
